Package: ootree
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign directory hierarchy and tree visualizer
 A directory hierarchy visualizer written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, Unicode/ASCII branch glyphs, oote palettes,
 JSON output, and a streaming MCP stdio surface.
